					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111010401,
					"content": "#讀完了嗎？派蒙比{F#妳}{M#你}先讀完的，嘿嘿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111010402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111010402,
					"content": "這是一本有關守護著璃月的「仙眾夜叉」們的書。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
